"description":"Sokobond Express is a beautifully minimalist puzzle game that combines chemical bonds and puzzling pathfinding in novel ways.\n\n\nThoughtfully curated and surprisingly deep, Sokobond Express takes the guesswork out of chemistry, letting you feel like a chemist without requiring any upfront chemistry knowledge. Immerse yourself in this delightful, mechanically intuitive, and elegant experience while getting lost in the art of rewarding puzzle solving.\n\n\n\"A delightful little puzzle game that doesn’t talk down to you\" - GameGrin\n\n\n\"A compound puzzler that should be added to your collection with express speed\" - EDGE\n\n\nThe minimalist mashup sequel to award-winning puzzle games Sokobond and Cosmic Express. Created by up-and-coming puzzle designer Jose Hernandez, and published by renowned puzzle experts Draknek & Friends (A Monster's Expedition, Bonfire Peaks).", "minimumOsVersion":"13.0", "trackCensoredName":"Sokobond Express", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/sokobond-express/id6484275400?uo=4", "averageUserRating":4.666669999999999873807610129006206989288330078125, "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "trackId":6484275400, "trackName":"Sokobond Express", "releaseDate":"2024-09-17T07:00:00Z", "userRatingCount":6}, 
